<li>Bianchi M., Boyle M., Hollingsworth D. (1999), "A comparison of methods for trend estimation", Applied Economics Letters, 6(2): 103–109.</li>
<li>Chatfield, C. (1993), "Calculating Interval Forecasts", Journal of Business and Economic Statistics, 11(2): 121–135.</li>
</ul>

